      "title": "CJP leaders Saurav Das, Ashutosh Ranka among 14 detained, booked after Jantar Mantar protest; FIRs over INDIA bloc march",
      "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/cjps-saurav-das-ashutosh-ranka-ajinkya-shinde-detained-near-jantar-mantar-dipke-says-cannot-de-notify-resistance/article71577984.ece",
      "description": "Detentions come a day after Delhi Police de-notified Jantar Mantar as a protest site; two FIRs registered over the INDIA bloc march held without permission in Central Delhi.",
      "source_name": "The Hindu National",
